Robbo Open edX — frontend-app-communications override
=====================================================

This repository is a Robbo fork/override of Open edX frontend-app-communications
(the bulk email page of the instructor dashboard).
Upstream: https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-communications .

Modifications and Robbo-specific files (including src/robbo/, src/robbo-layout/, src/sass/_robbo-brand-*.scss,
